<title>USA: Lexington to sell 2 mln shares.</title>
<headline>Lexington to sell 2 mln shares.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lexington Corporate Properties Inc said Monday it plans to sell two million shares of common stock in a public offering.</p>
<p>The company has 9.44 million shares outstanding.</p>
<p>Lexington said the offer is through an underwriting group lead-managed by Bear, Stearns &amp; Co Inc and including McDonald &amp; Company Securities Inc and UBS Securities.</p>
<p>The offering will be accomplished through a drawdown on an already effective shelf registration statement, Lexington said.</p>
</text>
